{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Christmas Story</strong> is a horror game that blends the warmth of Christmas evenings with chilling mysteries.<br><i>The average completion time is 60 minutes</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/da76d5c1688c6e0311bb5b6286044981.poster.avif?t=1765867269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/da76d5c1688c6e0311bb5b6286044981.webm?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/da76d5c1688c6e0311bb5b6286044981.mp4?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One winter evening, a grandson travels to a quiet, snow-covered village to visit his grandfather. The village house is filled with a cozy Christmas atmosphere: the fire crackles in the stove, garlands twinkle on the tree, and snowflakes swirl outside the window. Everything seems perfect until the grandfather decides to share an old Christmas story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the tale seems like a simple fairy tale, but as the story unfolds, the line between reality and fiction begins to blur. You find yourself drawn into a terrifying chain of events where Christmas symbols take on sinister forms, and the cozy atmosphere turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape this haunting story, or will you become a part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/1e2c37d21917fdef5e1e66d7c73deee5.poster.avif?t=1765867269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/1e2c37d21917fdef5e1e66d7c73deee5.webm?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/1e2c37d21917fdef5e1e66d7c73deee5.mp4?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Contrast:</strong> Experience a journey from cozy Christmas lights to dark horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Story:</strong> A narrative that evolves based on your actions and decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Secrets:</strong> Solve the mysteries of the village and uncover what lies behind the grandfather's story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed World:</strong> Explore an atmospheric village with intricate environments, from snowy forests to abandoned houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Moments:</strong> Unexpected scenes and eerie creatures inspired by Christmas mythology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/b6b16ee2af94817139f8405fb03780eb.poster.avif?t=1765867269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/b6b16ee2af94817139f8405fb03780eb.webm?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447620/extras/b6b16ee2af94817139f8405fb03780eb.mp4?t=1765867269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Story</strong> immerses you in an adventure where a Christmas evening could become the beginning of your worst nightmare.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Frozen \u2014 just like everything else around.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/cba5f5d56a10c87dae0a1968e6abdc3e297ce08c.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow snow.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/57ed5d22319d4a48cf82f71afcb85a30b26e9a61.jpg"},{"name":"Border Guard Day.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/0230421ac2fde70b4b7e3a7cc7ddb1a2d9269854.jpg"},{"name":"Cold snack.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/9851538f066e5361c20f64293d07643d2f872f10.jpg"},{"name":"Pixels of childhood.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/36eb7633b904ff83533ed4675be82144054988ae.jpg"},{"name":"Found something I wasn\u2019t looking for.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/0f77e379ba42bd575b662c65c2ca8aef5abebf22.jpg"},{"name":"I don\u2019t come here often\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/2e55c23f984b7669910f1da61aa7eb5852ed4919.jpg"},{"name":"Dimka\u2019s done it again.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/88d31445272254edb62560bd789f349246e755b6.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019d love to go for a ride\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/d3e3087439c7e45862df9965efcfbb8017201651.jpg"},{"name":"Mom's favorite horror book.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447620/6c0f89c459dafc1212396a812e97c928466acadd.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447620?t=1765867269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447620?t=1765867269","capsule_image":"https://shared.ak